        <baseMoodEffect>3</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>丰厚的宝库</label>
        <description>我躺在财宝上，感觉好极了。</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>6</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>传说中的宝库</label>
        <description>我的宝库足以让吟游诗人传唱千年。</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>12</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>伟龙的宝库</label>
        <description>金山银海堆到了天花板。世上再没有比这更配得上我的床。</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>15</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

